(The sky is still quiet when the boy starts tying the bamboo\056 The) Tj
T*
(boats are coming in\054 the wind has not arrived yet\054 and nobody) Tj
T*
(else on the beach seems worried\056 He knots each piece slowly) Tj
T*
(and pulls it tight\054 because he has seen what happens to the) Tj
T*
(ones who wait for the first drop of rain\056) Tj
T*
