13.5 TL
(Families are the same with money\056 The best time to build an) Tj
T*
(emergency fund\054 check your insurance\054 or look at your renewal) Tj
T*
(is when nothing is wrong\056 Storms do not send notice\056 The ones) Tj
T*
(who come through them are usually the ones who tied things) Tj
T*
(down on a calm day\056) Tj
